self.KB_CONTENT["card:781895"]={"id":"card:781895","ty":"card","sourceId":"781895","title":"『取替代料件建立作業』中的『品號屬性 (INV.MB025)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"品號","keywords":["品號","採購","加工","帶出"],"y":"other","answer":"* 由品號基本資料帶出，不可修改。* 區分為P.採購件、M.自製件、S.託外加工件、Y.虛設件、F.Feature件及O.Option件。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
