self.KB_CONTENT["field:780669"]={"id":"field:780669","ty":"field","sourceId":"780669","title":"選擇傳送方式","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"","keywords":[],"job":"IPSR14 SHIPPING INSTRUCTION","code":"","answer":"* 選擇列印傳送方式時，則進階選項的選擇FAX/Email傳送狀態、選擇FAX/Email傳送方式、FAX NO/Email Address，預覽列印頁上之FAX/列印鈕欄位，不可輸入。","file":"fields.jsonl"};
